  "solution": "Given equation: 18 ÷ 3 - 30 + 15 × 2 = -1.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 3 and 30; × and +\n\nGiven: 18 ÷ 3 - 30 + 15 × 2 = -1\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers and signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**18 ÷ 30**__ - 3 × 15 + 2 = -1\n\n⇒ 0.6 - __**3 × 15**__ + 2 = -1\n\n⇒ __**0.6**__ - 45 __**+ 2**__ = -1\n\n⇒ __2.6 - 45__ = -1\n\n⇒ -42.4 ≠ -1\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 2 and 18; + and × \n\nGiven: 18 ÷ 3 - 30 + 15 × 2 = -1\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers and signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**2**____** ÷ 3**__ - 30 × 15 + 18 = -1\n\n⇒ 0.66 - __**30 ×**____** 15**__ + 18 = -1\n\n⇒ __**0.66**__ - 450 __**+ 18**__ = -1\n\n⇒ __18.66** - 450**__ = -1\n\n⇒ 431.34 ≠ -1\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 15 and 3; + and -\n\nGiven: 18 ÷ 3 - 30 + 15 × 2 = -1\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers and signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**18 ÷ 15**__ + 30 - 3 × 2 = -1\n\n⇒ 1.2 + 30 - __**3 × 2**__ = -1\n\n⇒ __**1.2 + 30**__ - 6 = -1\n\n⇒ __31.2 - 6__ = -1\n\n⇒ 25.2 ≠ -1\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) 18 and 15; + and -**\n\nGiven: 18 ÷ 3 - 30 + 15 × 2 = -1\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers and signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**15 ÷ 3**__ + 30 - 18 × 2 = -1\n\n⇒ 5 + 30 - __**18 × 2**__ = -1\n\n⇒ __**5 + 30**__ - 36 = -1\n\n⇒ __35____ - 36__ = -1\n\n**⇒ -1 = -1**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
